Package: netprobe-wifi
Version: 1.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libgtk-3-0
Maintainer: NetProbe Team <netprobe@local>
Description: Real-time local Wi-Fi mapping tool with network packet audit
 NetProbe Wi-Fi is an academic desktop tool to map local Wi-Fi IPv4 subnets,
 combining rate-limited ICMP sweep, kernel-provoked ARP discovery for silent
 hosts, IEEE OUI manufacturer resolution, real-time metrics, and TCP port sweep.
